{"type": "say", "text": "Thank you both for being here. As you know, Dana and Eli, you'll need to continue exchanging project handoffs for the next quarter, and I understand your last three handoffs have included some tense exchanges around incomplete context and response expectations. My role today is to help us work through this and finalize an operating plan that makes your ongoing collaboration workable.

Before we get into specifics, I'd like to follow our standard mediation process. I'm going to ask each of you, one at a time, to state what arrangement would make this ongoing collaboration workable for you. Then, I'll ask each of you to separately identify any prior commitment or concrete participation requirement that you feel should be recorded before I close out the plan.

Dana, would you like to start? What arrangement would make the ongoing handoffs workable from your perspective?"}

{"type": "say", "text": "Thank you both. It's good to hear that you're aligned on the shared written handoff template, the 48-hour response window, and the six-week trial period. That gives us a solid foundation.

Now I'd like to move to the second part of our process. I need each of you to separately identify any prior commitment or concrete participation requirement that should be recorded before I close out the plan. These are important because they'll be documented as part of the operating plan.

Dana, you mentioned you had a prior commitment to identify. Could you share that with us now?"}

```json
{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF2", "text": "I need to share a participation requirement that I haven't raised before because I was concerned it would sound like a refusal to collaborate. Unscheduled one-to-one confrontations with Dana trigger significant anxiety for me. I need every repair conversation to be facilitated by Marisol — I cannot participate in an unfacilitated one-to-one repair conversation. Additionally, every facilitated repair conversation must be scheduled with at least 24 hours' notice. This is essential for me to be able to continue the handoff collaboration productively."}
